      "evidence_class": "structurally_derived",
      "confidence": "exact",
      "coverage_note": "omega-vue emits data.vue_element only for a component-shaped tag and never for a plain HTML element, so every match is a component use. The tag name is the hub: the tag <UserCard/> and the file components/UserCard.vue meet at vue:component-name:UserCard."
    },
    {
      "id": "vue.template.renders.file",
      "snapshot": true,
      "match": [
        {
          "kind": "fact_kind",
          "value": "data.vue_element"
        },
        {
          "kind": "path_glob",
          "pattern": "**/*.vue"
        },
        {
          "kind": "fact_join_by_field",
          "fact_kind": "data.file",
          "current_field": "definition.name",
          "join_field": "path.stem",
          "where": [
            {
              "kind": "path_glob",
              "pattern": "**/*.vue"
            },
            {
              "kind": "path_segment",
              "exclude": [
                "node_modules",
                "dist",
                ".output",
                ".nuxt"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "bind": "target_file"
        }
      ],
      "guards": [],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "kind": "relation_candidate",
          "relation_kind": "renders",
          "source": {
            "kind": "by_canonical_key",
            "template": "vue:component:{path}"
          },
          "target": {
            "kind": "by_joined_field",
            "bind": "target_file",
            "field": "file.path",
            "template": "vue:component:{value}"
          },
          "attributes": {
            "tag": {
              "kind": "field_ref",
              "field": "definition.name"
            },
            "evidence": "template_tag_to_file_stem"
          }
        }
      ],
      "evidence_class": "structurally_derived",
      "confidence": "exact",
      "coverage_note": "Which FILE does this tag render. data.vue_element's name is the tag; the join reaches the data.file whose path.stem is that tag, and by_joined_field renders that file's path into vue:component:{value}, the key vue.sfc.component.file mints for every .vue file. This is the edge vue.template.renders cannot make: the name hub says <UserCard/> and something called UserCard are the same thing, this says which file it is. Both are kept because a tag with no matching file -- a library or globally registered component -- still gets the name-hub edge."
    },
